<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH A-INVEST SAYS PUT UNDER FINMIN CONTROL.</title>
<headline>CZECH A-INVEST SAYS PUT UNDER FINMIN CONTROL.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A-Invest, the investment arm of the fifth largest Czech bank Agrobanka a.s., said on Wednesday that it had been put under the forced administration of the Czech Finance Ministry.</p>
<p>But Pavel Dvoracek, director of A-Invest, told Reuters that the ministry had yet to give a reason why the action was taken.</p>
</text>
